      "content": "The prioritization of political messaging over aesthetic beauty in contemporary art has indeed changed the art world. As artists focus more on transmitting social messages, the emphasis on traditional artistic skills and techniques has waned, and the value of art has become increasingly tied to its perceived social or cultural relevance. This shift in value can lead some collectors and curators to overlook an artist's technical skill and focus on the message behind their work. However, many still argue that the loss of craftsmanship and technique detracts from the overall value of the artwork.",
